# Embedded Postgres data directory (local dev only)
# Every local PGlite data directory, not just the default one. A throwaway
# verification database lived in `.pglite-verify` and the old `.pglite/` rule
# did not match it, so 1,116 database files were staged by a `git add -A`.
.pglite*/

